        "dossierExcerpt": "The roster coordinate sits squarely on a very large rectangular distribution\nwarehouse with rooftop solar panels. Web research (Yelp, Manta, Foursquare,\nYellowpages, CMac) all list the **Cost Plus World Market Stockton Distribution\nCenter at 3610 S Airport Way, Stockton CA 95206**, and a Kaleris case study\nnames it as the company's West Coast DC. A 500,000 sq ft DC was built for Cost\nPlus World Market by Ellis-Gibson Development — consistent with the footprint\nseen here. The roster geocode (ROOTOP, moved 2,396 m) landed correctly on the\nbuilding. The truck gate is separately listed as \"Cost Plus World Market Truck\nGate\" at 1735 Zephyr St on Waze, with operating hours Mon-Sat 07:00-16:00.\nBuilding positively identified.",
