          "truckGate": "A named 'Cost Plus World Market Truck Gate' business exists at 1735 Zephyr St per Waze, with managed hours (Mon-Sat 07:00-16:00). The entire property is enclosed by a continuous block/concrete perimeter wall plus hedge along Zephyr St and chain-link fence around the north and south trailer yards. Truck gate confirmed by listing; treated as true.",
          "guardShack": "No guard booth was visible in any Street View pano along Zephyr St (continuous wall), nor at the open office driveway on the east side. No 1-3-vehicle-footprint booth structure identified at any entrance - low confidence.",
          "remoteGs": "Set true because a controlled/named truck gate exists but no guard shack could be confirmed visually - implies kiosk/call-box/app check-in. Medium confidence.",
          "dockDoors": "Dock doors run along both the long north face (trailers backed in, visible at z19-20) and the long south face (trailers along the rail line). Combined estimate ~90 doors across the ~250m+ building faces - clearly the 50+ band.",
          "shipRcvSeparate": "Two distinct dock banks on opposite (north and south) faces of the building, suggesting separate ship/receive clusters. Medium confidence - could also be one continuous receiving operation.",
