          "trailersVisible": "~240 trailers counted across the north drop yard, NE angled stalls, and the large south drop yard - approximate honest estimate from overhead imagery.",
          "entryLanes": "Could not positively count gate lanes - estimate 1 in / 1 out at a shared truck gate.",
