          "guardShack": "A small rectangular guard-booth structure is clearly visible at z20 sitting on a triangular paved island at the SE corner of the building, with the truck lane splitting around it (in/out). Web research (TruckMap driver notes) explicitly states 'Check-in is at the security guard shack.' High confidence.",
